From: Xavier Ruiz <github@xav.ie>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:04:22 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Add an opt-in JSONL usage log of MCP searches and tool
 calls

EXECUTOR_USAGE_LOG=<path> makes the local server append one line per search
(tools.search, the MCP search tool and CodeMode's global search()), describe
and tool call, with canonical paths, outcome and timing but never arguments
or results. Each line carries the MCP session ID and a per request execution
ID, so offline evals can join a search to the tools the session called next.

The shared MCP package records through an McpUsage reference that is unset by
default, so hosts that do not provide it behave as before.
